  "adaptations": [
    "No new buildings generated. Authored glTF geometry and real PBR materials retained.",
    "Building coordinates and meter scale unchanged. Models are not centered; consumers must use supplied exact bounds.",
    "Poly Haven modular display-grid node translations removed; local authored vertices retained. Six modules simplified with MeshoptSimplifier ratio0.2,error0.001,locked borders.",
    "Deduplication and pruning; no runtime compression extension required.",
    "Color textures max1024px; normal and packed ORM/ARM data textures max512px. All meaningful alpha preserved. JPEG color/data encoding does not imply a data color space change.",
    "Texture images embedded in each self-contained GLB. Scene instances should reuse geometries and materials. Files share some texture families; GPU memory may exceed the downloaded byte size.",
    "Far building LODs use attribute-aware MeshoptSimplifier, target15%, error.015, normal/UV weights.1. Six extreme referenced vertices per primitive are locked; any lost extremal authored triangle is retained to preserve exact bounds. Textures and material bindings unchanged; consumers should reuse original textures/materials."
  ],
